00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.970
Oh, that is with...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.820
All due respect to you, Mr. Reamer.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.560
That's all right, Peggy. That's an idea, all right.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.000
