00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.500
And say, here's a bigger one.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.420
With Robert's story at Palm Inn,

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:44.340
everybody at White Beach will leave their hotels flat and flock over to us.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.510
Is he really going to stay at the inn?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.020
Well, he doesn't know it, but he is.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:53.660
Because he'll be met at the train by two irresistible gals.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.060
This don't sound so good for me.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.280
