00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.220
If I were you, I wouldn't worry about story.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:13.900
Well, I am.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.570
If Howard's plane beats me, it'll prove that my engine is obsolete,

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:18.830
