00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.520
I'm not afraid of story.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.740
I've read his book, and I'm betting he's a fake.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.040
Well, it's a thing to find out.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.060
Your receipt, please.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:07.310
You.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:13.070
Two.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:14.770
And two more.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.600
Well, that cures me.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:19.320
Me too.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.920
I'll say your two and two.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:42.960
Well, let me see. I'll stay there's your two and I've bumped you two more

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:49.280
Quite a plot. How far you fellas going at all depends on you on me

